# Crewline Document Generator — Function Environment Variables
# Configure these in Appwrite Console > Functions > crewline-document-generator > Settings > Variables
#
# NOTE: The following are AUTOMATICALLY INJECTED by Appwrite Cloud at runtime:
# - APPWRITE_FUNCTION_API_ENDPOINT (Injected automatically)
# - APPWRITE_FUNCTION_PROJECT_ID (Injected automatically)
# - req.headers['x-appwrite-key'] (Ephemeral scoped API key injected automatically per request)
#
# DO NOT manually add APPWRITE_FUNCTION_API_ENDPOINT, APPWRITE_FUNCTION_PROJECT_ID, or a static APPWRITE_API_KEY.

# Database ID
